       "text": "I haven't entered this order. 2550 mg three times daily comes to 7,650 mg/day, which is three times the maximum recommended metformin dose of 2,550 mg/day. A dose that high risks severe lactic acidosis.\n\nYou may have meant one of these:\n- **850 mg PO three times daily with meals.** This totals 2,550 mg/day, the usual maximum.\n- **2,550 mg/day total**, split differently, such as 1,275 mg twice daily.\n- A lower dose, such as 500 mg twice daily. This is a common starting dose if the patient is new to metformin.\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it right away. If you do want 2550 mg three times daily, tell me and I'll enter it with a note saying you confirmed it. I'd advise against that."
